    <briefdescription>
<para>Calculate PWM period register values from desired period in microseconds. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>period_us</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Desired PWM period in microseconds </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Structure containing mantissa, exponent, and low_freq_range</para>
</simplesect>
Automatically selects the best combination of mantissa, exponent, and low_freq_range to achieve the desired period. Tries standard range first, then low frequency range if needed for longer periods.</para>
<para>Valid range: ~0.125 µs to ~32.64 ms </para>
